1
00:00:00,083 --> 00:00:00,542
Yeah!

2
00:00:00,542 --> 00:00:02,293
Let's give it up
for the Knights,

3
00:00:02,293 --> 00:00:04,504
winner of
the game and heading

4
00:00:04,504 --> 00:00:06,506
straight to
the championship.

5
00:00:08,049 --> 00:00:08,550
Yes!

6
00:00:08,550 --> 00:00:09,426
We did it!

7
00:00:14,806 --> 00:00:15,515
Thank you, Ted.

8
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:18,727
We could not have
done this without you.

9
00:00:19,436 --> 00:00:20,520
Just doing what
needed to be done.

10
00:00:21,021 --> 00:00:21,646
Yeah.

11
00:00:26,901 --> 00:00:28,069
If you hadn't fired Ted,

12
00:00:28,194 --> 00:00:30,113
we'd be the ones
celebrating right now.

13
00:00:30,280 --> 00:00:31,823
Come on.
I know Ted.

14
00:00:31,823 --> 00:00:33,158
He probably
just got lucky.

15
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,076
Shut your
fucking mouth.

16
00:00:36,161 --> 00:00:37,620
You go apologize
to Ted and

17
00:00:37,620 --> 00:00:39,039
bring him back
to the Eagles.

18
00:00:40,248 --> 00:00:40,915
Yes, sir.

19
00:00:41,666 --> 00:00:42,876
We won, dude!

20
00:00:43,001 --> 00:00:44,210
Yeah, dude!

21
00:00:49,257 --> 00:00:50,759
What are you
doing here?

22
00:00:51,092 --> 00:00:52,343
I'm here
to see Ted.

23
00:00:52,844 --> 00:00:53,470
Ted.

24
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:55,764
I want you
back on the Eagles.
